vidence_ids":["link.euler.proposition-5.1"],"id":"euler.proposition-5.1","kind":"claim","label":"Proposition 5.1","locator":"Proposition 5.1, Section 5","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Proposition 5.1.** There is an absolute exponent $C$ such that each coefficient $c$ among $$(D_aX)^{\\pm1},\\qquad M,\\qquad\n \\kappa/\\lambda,\\qquad \\lambda^2/|\\kappa|^2,\\qquad P_\\kappa$$ satisfies (D.6). Let $f(t,x)$ be a field with values in a normed space such that $|f|_m\\le C_m'A_f\\mathsf D^m$ for every $m\\ge0$ and a number $A_f$. Then $$\\begin{equation}\n |f\\circ X|_m\\le C_mA_f\\mathsf D^{Cm}\\qquad(m\\ge0). \\tag{5.7}\n\\end{equation}$$ Consequently, for every $n\\ge0$, $$\\begin{equation}\n \\|c\\|_{[n]}\\le C_n\\mathsf D^C,\\qquad\n \\|f\\circ X\\|_{[n]}\\le C_nA_f . \\tag{5.8}\n\\end{equation}$$","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.proposition-5.1","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-5.10","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-5.10%22%2C%22euler.proposition-5.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-5.10%22%2C%22euler.proposition-5.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.proposition-5.1"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/nodes/euler.lemma-5.3","id":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0afe1/edges/%5B%22euler.lemma-5.3%22%2C%22euler.proposition-5.1%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:db48fdd5ba2604749972848ed79e43c2768fdab18b46be5a44ed5375dec0